Be sure that you are comparing apples to apples.  Sometimes, the license
may be cheaper on one platform, but one also has to take into account how
the license is structured (e.g. node locked (whether enforced or by honor
system), per user, or floating licenses that count concurrent users), since
the license structure options may differ on various platforms.

