luck with the one using the DEC part.

Then see what version of Digital Unix you're using.  PCI-PCI bridges require
operating system support on the Alpha.

Several of Digital's own PCI cards have bridges on them -- even
single-function cards like their ISP1020-based SCSI card -- so I'd be
surprised if they don't work at all.

