exchange was botched, causing far more down time than necessary. As a
college freshman buying his first computer for school, this was a
frustrating situation.

The moral of my whining is to say that if you are lucky enough to get the
system you pay for without any hassles (as we were with our first system),
then Polywell is a good company, but if you ever need a problem resolved,
