>>I'm in search of a Q-bus interface for a LexiData 3400-12 display. We
>>presently have this LexiData on a VAX 8550 which it being retired. I'd
>>like to continue to make the display available for the developers moving
>>software off this display technology for comparison purposes. (Does the
