>I need to simulate user activity under Digital 4.0 to test out performance
>on a two-node 4100 cluster.  Any pointers, tips, suggestions would be
>greatly appreciated.

>I need to log in each user in NIS to test their users shell.  It would be
>nice if I could test out the validity of their .profile and .cshrc files.
