  I don't have the documentation but managed to get mine going.  The manual
apparently has a series of commands that will let you get at the on-board
diagnostics and setup software from a MicroVAX II but I could never get it to
work.  However, that header beside the SCSI connector is compatible with the
serial port header on MVII (KA630) CPU boards (DH11?  Don't recall what it's
