Pin 1 - RxGnd
Pin 2 - RxD
Pin 3 - TxGnd
Pin 4 - CTS
Pin 5 - RTS
Pin 6 - TxD
Pin 7 - DTR
Pin 8 - DSR

The interface is EIA-423.  This means that RxGnd is floating at the port
and needs to be grounded.  On short runs it is common to tie Pins 1 and 3
together.

