running on time (sometime) next year. My wishlist for the 21364 is:

- Sustained 8 instr/cycle (out of 12+ execution units)
- twice the 21264 cache and mem bandwidth on the same clock
- expansion of MVI and count instructions to also include full set of 
SIMD arithmetic instr for MVI (would help Photoshop) and more stuff like 
in Tera supercomputer for count extensions. That would make the 21364 the 
ultimate desktop/deskside supercomputer CPU

