 Wow, what a wide opened question.  A couple quick simple answers:
1. Use submit command (see help) to set up the batch job to run every
hour, put the submit command withing the .com itself so it will
re-submit itself when it runs.
2. Just put a Wait command in your .com file to wait for 1 hour and then
goto the beginning again.
3. See dcl books and help for On_error trapping




