> Jasza wrote:
> > 
> > Six Decs were donated to our organization where I teach beginning
> > computing to senior citizens.  However, no monitors were included.  Our
> > old pcs had 9 pin color monitors.  I purchased an adapter to make them 16
> > pin to fit the Dec Stations but can't get them to work.  What must I do to
> > make the EGA and RGB monitors work with the Dec Stations?  (I have them
> > setup with Windows 3.11 and other software programs and they work great
> > with a VGA monitor).
> > 
> > Thanks for any input.
