keyboard. (Does word processing come to mind?)  Also, in the UNIX
environment as well as DOS, the keyboard is often faster than the mouse
since you  don't have to wait for the pretty pictures to come up.  You
can perform simple tasks in the same time it takes for a GUI to even
load.

