On Tue, 27 May 1997 16:05:35 -0400, Sepehr Kiani <skiani@mit.edu> wrote:

>I'm trying to run microsoft Project 95 (4.1a) on a alpha NT machine
>under fx!32 but it fails to run. Installation was through fx!32
