Posting the results which we agreed worked for both of us...

1. Obtain the MS Project95 evaluation software from the MS
    Website.
2. Install the eval copy of the software under FX!32.
3. Save the file WINPROJ.EXE to a temporary directory.
4. Uninstall the evaluation software.
5. Install the full MS Project95 v4.1a (not v4.1!)
6. Copy the saved copy of WINPROJ.EXE over
    the version installed in Step #5.

The file WINPROJ.EXE from the evaluation copy has
some recent patches which cause it to work well under
FX!32 on Alpha/NT.  Windows NT v4.00.1381 (SP2)
was used for this test.



