Bryan Althaus wrote:
> 
> Since when was Digital ever a shown a PRO UNIX showing?  Remember the
> quote of "UNIX is snake oil" from the founder and x-CEO of Digital.

That was a mis-quote.  I don't remember the whole sentence exactly,
but it was something along the lines of, "Unix is snake oil if you
think it's the solution to all portability problems".  Or something
like that anyway.   Some jerk of a journalist just snipped out the
bit they wanted to use and sensationalised it.  Ken's only mistake
there was that he let it ride, rather than stomping on it.

