would have no impact on the market unless a significant portfolio
of applications were ported along with it.  That's not likely to
happen unless Sun decide they need the speed of Alpha real bad. And
they seem to be doing quite well financially with what they've got at
the moment.  However, in the near future, when there are a significant
number of Java apps available that run equally as well on Alpha as
they do on Sparc ... who knows!

