References: <m0wStLZ-000I15C@ivan.iecc.com> <5mlc9e$ah6@tooting.netapp.com> <1997May30.021200.1@eisner> <338F3805.1EFF@world.std.com> <mjrEB3Lr1.5DD@netcom.com>
